      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Motor that read models. \nJSON and PNG and everything, \nand it have animations and more\nRead Animations \nBut not total Control.\nNot optimized for web.",
